{"ticker":"IONQ","updated":"2026-10-30T22:53:55Z","profile":{"longName":"IonQ, Inc.","shortName":"IonQ, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ionq.com","fullTimeEmployees":1132,"marketCap":12899406848,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-22.348364,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":52.33577,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":64.06071,"targetHighPrice":100.0,"targetLowPrice":41.85,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":2.868,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.30854,"operatingMargins":-4.08174,"profitMargins":0.0,"totalRevenue":246474000,"beta":3.361,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":73.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":25.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"IonQ, Inc. develops quantum computing systems in the United States, Switzerland, and Internationally. It sells access to quantum computers of various qubit capacities. The company also makes access to its quantum computers through cloud platforms, such as Amazon Web Services (AWS), Braket, Microsoft's Azure Quantum, and Google's Cloud Marketplace, as well as through its cloud service. The company engages in quantum-safe communications and quantum detection systems. It provides contracts associated with the design, development, construction, and sale of specialized quantum computing hardware systems; maintenance and support services; and consulting services related to co-developing algorithms on quantum computing systems. In addition, it provides semiconductor manufacturing services. The company has a collaboration agreement with University of Chicago. The company was founded in 2015 and is headquartered in College Park, Maryland.","summary_zh":"IonQ, Inc. 在美國、瑞士和國際上開發量子計算系統。它出售各種量子位元容量的量子電腦的使用權。該公司還透過雲端平台（例如亞馬遜網路服務（AWS）、Braket、微軟的Azure Quantum和Google的雲端市場）及其雲端服務存取其量子電腦。該公司從事量子安全通訊和量子檢測系統。它提供與專業量子計算硬體系統的設計、開發、建構和銷售相關的合約；維護和支援服務；以及與共同開發量子計算系統演算法相關的諮詢服務。此外，它還提供半導體製造服務。該公司與芝加哥大學簽訂了合作協議。該公司成立於 2015 年，總部位於馬裡蘭州大學公園市。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電腦硬體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":41.035,"h":43.05,"l":40.22,"c":42.99,"v":13787100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":42.645,"h":43.21,"l":40.58,"c":40.97,"v":10369800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":41.23,"h":43.03,"l":40.79,"c":42.11,"v":13213900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":42.46,"h":42.73,"l":40.51,"c":41.8,"v":11508900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":42.09,"h":42.59,"l":40.38,"c":41.01,"v":10501700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":41.39,"h":44.26,"l":41.045,"c":44.0,"v":17694900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":44.31,"h":45.18,"l":43.56,"c":43.86,"v":14430000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":44.2,"h":47.23,"l":43.38,"c":47.05,"v":21599100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":47.3,"h":56.07,"l":47.15,"c":55.61,"v":68818800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":56.88,"h":59.89,"l":55.95,"c":59.11,"v":34677000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":58.98,"h":62.85,"l":57.131,"c":62.26,"v":30636600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":63.31,"h":66.39,"l":61.08,"c":65.44,"v":49629900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":68.57,"h":70.43,"l":65.42,"c":66.81,"v":45892900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":65.98,"h":71.3,"l":65.64,"c":70.41,"v":50959400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":68.11,"h":73.17,"l":66.15,"c":71.94,"v":35675500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":74.08,"h":76.129,"l":71.45,"c":75.14,"v":40011900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":75.25,"h":75.95,"l":71.01,"c":73.86,"v":33075600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":71.16,"h":72.29,"l":66.91,"c":69.43,"v":44799700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":68.41,"h":70.42,"l":65.33,"c":67.28,"v":32156900},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":68.38,"h":68.88,"l":63.22,"c":64.26,"v":27595300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":63.59,"h":65.0,"l":60.59,"c":61.5,"v":22600600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":61.385,"h":64.85,"l":60.14,"c":63.09,"v":33912400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":64.81,"h":69.6,"l":64.41,"c":69.6,"v":37383600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":70.59,"h":73.76,"l":68.35,"c":73.28,"v":37681800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":72.0,"h":79.23,"l":71.88,"c":78.99,"v":36301000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":80.96,"h":82.97,"l":75.48,"c":79.23,"v":47589100},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":78.95,"h":82.41,"l":72.599,"c":74.3,"